# User-downloaded source archives stay local; reviewed imported assets are versioned separately.
/Assets/*.unitypackage
/Assets/*.unitypackage.meta
/Assets/23102026/
/Assets/23102026.meta
# Raw import drops are reviewed into the tracked asset baseline; keep the source archives local.
/Assets/25102026/
